== Description ==
'''Radical''' is an [[Emotes|emote]] that can be bought in the store for {{Coins|1,500}}. The animation was made by [https://www.roblox.com/users/681405668/profile RostTyme]. The emote is looped and music can be heard while performing the emote. You are able to move while performing this emote.

